  "description": "A classic of the Counter-Strike series, the edge of this knife is press-fit Stellite perfectly held in place due to its precise fit with the titanium on the blade's cheek and spine. The handle is fossilized mastodon ivory held in a carbon fibre pocket. It has been painted using a spider web-patterned hydrographic over a red base coat and finished with a semi-gloss topcoat.\\n\\n<i>Be careful where you walk, you never know where the web is spread</i>",
